## Interface: 16001
## Title: Ziri's Toolkit
## Notes: Small helpers in one addon: Loot Highlight, Fresh Ranks, cleanse buttons, thanking people who buff you, an undress button, boat times, a tidier friends list, an instance limit counter, rested XP per character, buff reminders, a flight timer, threat for tanks and a page for console settings.
